sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant SS as Consumer secrets stack
    participant SM as Secret Manager
    participant ESO as ESO (ns kafka, qa-eso-kafka)
    participant UO as User Operator
    participant C as Client (ns orders or VPC)
    participant K as Kafka broker

    SS->>SM: qa-orders-kafka-events, generated write-only value
    SS->>SM: secretAccessor for qa-eso-kafka and for the client's identity
    ESO->>SM: reads with Workload Identity
    ESO-->>UO: Secret orders-events in ns kafka
    UO->>K: SCRAM credential, ACLs and quotas of KafkaUser orders-events
    C->>SM: reads the password under its own identity (own ESO or service account)
    C->>K: TLS to 9093 or 3210x, validates the broker with internal-ca-bundle
    C->>K: SASL SCRAM-SHA-512 as orders-events
    Note over K: principal User:orders-events, ACLs only on orders-*
    K-->>C: produces and consumes on orders-*
